; The Eunoia signature defining the @CALCULUS@ calculus: its sorts, its
; operators and its proof rules.
;
; This is a stub. Replace it with the signature of the calculus, either by
; editing here or by rerunning the generator with --signature pointing at one:
;
;   scripts/new-checker.sh --signature <path>/@CALCULUS@.eo --force
;
; Eunoia is the language of the Ethos proof checker; its reference is at
; https://github.com/cvc5/ethos.
